@startuml
title Dashboard + OpenSpec Validation - Diagrama de Secuencia

actor Developer
participant "GitHub Actions" as CI
participant "Vitest" as Vitest
participant "Spec Validator\nvalidateSpec.ts" as Validator
participant "parseOpenSpec.ts" as ParseSpec
participant "extractTestCases.ts" as ScanTests
participant "openspec/*.yaml" as OpenSpec
participant "src/modules/dashboard/**/*.test.tsx" as DashboardTests

Developer -> CI: push / pull_request
CI -> Vitest: npm run test -- --run
Vitest -> DashboardTests: ejecuta tests
DashboardTests --> Vitest: pass/fail
Vitest --> CI: resultado

CI -> Validator: npm run spec:validate
Validator -> ParseSpec: parseOpenSpec(projectRoot)
ParseSpec -> OpenSpec: leer behavior + contract
OpenSpec --> ParseSpec: scenarios[].id
ParseSpec --> Validator: specIds

Validator -> ScanTests: extractTestCases(projectRoot)
ScanTests -> DashboardTests: escanear [SPEC:DASH-XXX]
DashboardTests --> ScanTests: spec tags
ScanTests --> Validator: test specIds + byFile

Validator -> Validator: comparar cobertura
alt missingSpecs o unknownTags
  Validator --> CI: exit code 1
else alineado
  Validator --> CI: exit code 0
end

CI --> Developer: estado de pipeline
@enduml
